{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-23T15:54:27.741Z","data":{"text":"Task 4 is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\n- **archive**: calls `project_git_root` after `load_config` and passes the kernel's git answer into `lookup::find`, which no longer reads `config.vcs.enabled` or lists worktrees without a git root.\n- **retry**: loads config and calls `project_git_root` before reading changes; `find_archived` takes the kernel's answer instead of running its own `GitVcs::root` check.\n- **run**: `git_on` now delegates to `project_git_root`; `refusals::check` passes that answer to `find_change` and uses a kernel-based repository check for run's \"needs git\" refusal.\n- Added `archive_nested_root.rs`, `retry_nested_root.rs`, and `run_nested_root.rs`, each building `<outer>` and proving the crate's `NestedRoot` refusal while leaving the repository untouched.\n- Ran `cargo fmt --all`, the task verify, full tests for all three crates, clippy, and the proposal verify with `OSQ_CHANGE` set. Mutation check: 15 mutants, 11 caught, 4 unviable.\n\nResult written to `openspec/changes/315-vcs-root-fails-fast/.run/results/4.md`."}}
